"[HEADER] Connection Infos",
"kill",
"Once everything is set up, a new AP Connection window should appear in the main menu.\n\nIn the 1st field ('Host'), enter 'archipelago.gg'.\n\nIn the 2nd field ('Port'), enter the room's port, this is a 5-digit number that can be found when creating a new room on the Archipelago website.\n\nIn the 3nd field ('Slot Name'), enter the name assigned to your YAML file.\n\nThe 4th field, the Password, is optional. If the host did not set a password, leave it blank.\n\nFinally, click 'Connect' and then you can start playing!",
